  "description": "If only I could know your heart, even just once.   \n\nIna has had a crush on her childhood friend, Suhyuk, since middle school.\n\nDespite spending so much time together, she has no way of knowing what goes on behind his quiet and expressionless demeanor, so she hides her feelings.\n\nThen one day, while hiking with Suhyuk for a school assignment, she drinks from the 'Wish-Granting Mineral Spring'... and suddenly, she can hear Suhyuk's inner thoughts?!\n\n'…Ha, why is Seo Ina so pretty today? Makes me want to nail her right now.'\n\nBeyond his expressionless face, she hears lewd delusions directed solely at her.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14724640)",
